name "fig:8_7"

\end_inset

类似态能谱示意图。
\end_layout

\end_inset

\end_layout

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
为了进一步了解类似共振的结构，我们暂时忽略在描述母核（
\begin_inset Formula $N,Z$
\end_inset
）基态时所使用的剩余相互作用。后者由纯壳模型描述给出，如
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:8_8"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
 所示。
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Float figure
placement H
wide false
sideways false
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
\align center
\begin_inset Graphics
	filename pictures/8_8.pdf
	width 25text%

\end_inset

