\begin_layout Section
粒子-粒子 RPA
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sec:8.8_粒子-粒子_RPA"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
形式理论
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "subsec:8.8.1_形式理论"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
正如在 Tamm-Dancoff 方法中我们区分粒子-空穴与粒子-粒子 TDA（第 8.2.3 节）一样，对应于 ph RPA，我们同样拥有粒子-粒子（pp）RPA。对于 
\begin_inset Formula $A+2$
\end_inset
 系统的本征态 
\begin_inset Formula $|\tau\rangle$
\end_inset
，类比于 ph 拟设 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:rpa_creation_operator"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
)，我们有：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
|A+2,\tau\rangle=R_{\tau}^{\dagger}|A,0\rangle\label{eq:pprpa_state_ansatz}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
属于 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 体系的基态由下式定义：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
R_{\tau}|A,0\rangle=0\label{eq:pprpa_vacuum_def}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
在与式 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:rpa_xy_amplitudes_density"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 相同的准玻色子近似下，我们得到：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
X_{mn}^{\tau} & =\langle A,0|a_{n}a_{m}|A+2,\tau\rangle,\nonumber \\
Y_{ij}^{\tau} & =\langle A,0|a_{j}a_{i}|A+2,\tau\rangle\label{eq:pprpa_amplitudes_def}
\end{align}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
利用 
\begin_inset Formula $R_{\tau}^{\dagger}$
\end_inset
 的运动方程，完全类比于 ph 情形（第 8.4.1 节），我们导出 
\begin_inset Formula $A+2$
\end_inset
 核系统相对于 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 核基态的激发能 
\begin_inset Formula $\hbar\Omega_{\tau}=E_{\tau}^{A+2}-E_{0}^{A}$
\end_inset
 所满足的方程［FIS 64, Sch 64b, MLE 67, Ro 68a, b, RP 69］：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
(\hbar\Omega_{\tau}-\epsilon_{m}-\epsilon_{n})X_{mn}^{\tau}=\sum_{m'<n'}\bar{v}_{mnm'n'}X_{m'n'}^{\tau}+\sum_{i'<j'}\bar{v}_{mni'j'}Y_{i'j'}^{\tau}\label{eq:pprpa_plus2_eq}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
对于 
\begin_inset Formula $A-2$
\end_inset
 粒子系统，我们同样得到完全对应的方程：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
(\hbar\Omega_{\lambda}+\epsilon_{i}+\epsilon_{j})Y_{ij}^{\lambda}=-\sum_{i'<j'}\bar{v}_{iji'j'}Y_{i'j'}^{\lambda}-\sum_{m'<n'}\bar{v}_{ijm'n'}X_{m'n'}^{\lambda}\label{eq:pprpa_minus2_eq}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
式中 
\begin_inset Formula $\hbar\Omega_{\lambda}=E_{0}^{A}-E_{\lambda}^{A-2}$
\end_inset
。由此，我们可以将方程 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:pprpa_plus2_eq"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 与 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:pprpa_minus2_eq"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 合并为一个类似于 ph 形式的紧凑矩阵方程：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\begin{pmatrix}A & B\\
B^{\dagger} & C
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}X^{\tau}\\
Y^{\tau}
\end{pmatrix}=\hbar\Omega_{\tau}\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\
0 & -1
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}X^{\tau}\\
Y^{\tau}
\end{pmatrix}\label{eq:pprpa_matrix_eq}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
式中（
\begin_inset Formula $m<n,\,m'<n',\,i<j,\,i'<j'$
\end_inset
）：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
A_{mnm'n'} & =(\epsilon_{m}+\epsilon_{n})\delta_{mm'}\delta_{nn'}+\bar{v}_{mnm'n'},\nonumber \\
C_{iji'j'} & =-(\epsilon_{i}+\epsilon_{j})\delta_{ii'}\delta_{jj'}-\bar{v}_{iji'j'},\nonumber \\
B_{mnij} & =\bar{v}_{mnij}\label{eq:pprpa_matrix_blocks}
\end{align}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
需要指出的是，Hermitian 矩阵 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 与 
\begin_inset Formula $C$
\end_inset
 通常具有不同的维度，矩阵 
\begin_inset Formula $B$
\end_inset
 因而是一个长方阵。方程 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:pprpa_matrix_eq"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 同时给出了 
\begin_inset Formula $A+2$
\end_inset
 与 
\begin_inset Formula $A-2$
\end_inset
 系统的本征态，这与 ph 情形不同（在 ph 情形中所有解属于相同粒子数的系统）。然而，这并不意味着 pp RPA 破坏了粒子数守恒（如 BCS 模型所做的那样），拟设 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:pprpa_state_ansatz"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 严格保持粒子数。在实践中，我们可以根据波函数的振幅特征识别出属于 
\begin_inset Formula $A+2$
\end_inset
 体系的解：它们具有很大的 pp 分量 
\begin_inset Formula $X_{mn}$
\end_inset
 与极小的 hh 分量 
\begin_inset Formula $Y_{ij}$
\end_inset
，能量位于 
\begin_inset Formula $\epsilon_{m}+\epsilon_{n}$
\end_inset
 能区。
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
pp-RPA 本征矢满足如下归一化与完备性关系：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\sum_{m<n}X_{mn}^{\tau*}X_{mn}^{\tau'}-\sum_{i<j}Y_{ij}^{\tau*}Y_{ij}^{\tau'}=\delta_{\tau\tau'}\label{eq:pprpa_orthonormality}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\sum_{\tau}\left(X_{mn}^{\tau}X_{m'n'}^{\tau*}-Y_{mn}^{\tau}Y_{m'n'}^{\tau*}\right)=\delta_{mm'}\delta_{nn'}\label{eq:pprpa_closure}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
对振动诱发的基态关联
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "subsec:8.8.2_对振动诱发的基态关联"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
利用 Thouless 定理，pp RPA 基态同样可表示为指数形式：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
|\text{RPA}\rangle=N_{0}\exp\left(\sum_{m<n,\,i<j}Z_{mnij}A_{mn}^{\dagger}A_{ij}\right)|\text{HF}\rangle\label{eq:pprpa_ground_state_correlated}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
式中 
\begin_inset Formula $A_{mn}^{\dagger}=a_{m}^{\dagger}a_{n}^{\dagger}$
\end_inset
，
\begin_inset Formula $A_{ij}=a_{j}a_{i}$
\end_inset
，且 
\begin_inset Formula $Z=Y^{*}X^{*-1}$
\end_inset
。展开式 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:pprpa_ground_state_correlated"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 可以看出，关联基态除 
\begin_inset Formula $|\text{HF}\rangle$
\end_inset
 外还包含了带有成对玻色子的虚激发，由于 pp 玻色子数目严格等于 hh 玻色子数目，粒子数是严格守恒的。
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
对于纯配对力 
\begin_inset Formula $-G$
\end_inset
，式 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:pprpa_matrix_eq"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 导出如下色散关系：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\frac{2}{G}=\sum_{n}\frac{2j_{n}+1}{2\epsilon_{n}-\hbar\Omega}+\sum_{i}\frac{2j_{i}+1}{2|\epsilon_{i}|+\hbar\Omega}\label{eq:pprpa_pairing_dispersion}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
当配对力常数 
\begin_inset Formula $G$
\end_inset
 增大至临界值：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
G_{\text{crit}}=\frac{2}{\sum_{n}\frac{2j_{n}+1}{2\epsilon_{n}}+\sum_{i}\frac{2j_{i}+1}{2|\epsilon_{i}|}}\label{eq:pprpa_gcrit_def}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
时，最低集体对振动的激发能 
\begin_inset Formula $\hbar\Omega\to 0$
\end_inset
，标志着正常核系统发生向超流态（BCS 凝聚）的相变。在 
\begin_inset Formula $G>G_{\text{crit}}$
\end_inset
 时，BCS 能隙方程具有非零解 
\begin_inset Formula $\Delta>0$
\end_inset
，此时必须采用准粒子表象。
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section
准粒子 RPA（QRPA）
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sec:8.9_准粒子RPA（QRPA）"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
在远离闭壳层时，配对关联极其重要，使得配对场对单粒子运动的反馈不再能够忽略。我们在第 6 章和第 7 章已经看到，在这些情形下，采用 BCS 或 HFB 基态是恰当的。由于它也是一个广义行列式波函数，我们可以完全类比于正常系统构造 TDA 和 RPA 理论［Ba 60a］。由此将显现出：粒子-空穴 RPA 与粒子-粒子 RPA 可以被统一包容于一个紧凑的准粒子 RPA（QRPA）方程之中［So 71］。
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
为了推导这些方程，我们从准粒子表象下的 Hamiltonian 量［式 (E.18)］出发：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
H=H^{0}+H^{11}+H^{20}+H^{40}+H^{31}+H^{22}\label{eq:qrpa_h_quasiparticle_decomp}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
准粒子声子算符定义为：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
Q_{\nu}^{\dagger}=\sum_{k<k'}\left(X_{kk'}^{\nu}\alpha_{k}^{\dagger}\alpha_{k'}^{\dagger}-Y_{kk'}^{\nu}\alpha_{k'}\alpha_{k}\right)\label{eq:qrpa_phonon_creation_def}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
类比于第 8.4.1 节的推导，我们得到准粒子 RPA 方程，其矩阵形式与式 (
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:rpa_matrix_equation"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset
) 完全一致：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\begin{pmatrix}A & B\\
B^{*} & A^{*}
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}X^{\nu}\\
Y^{\nu}
\end{pmatrix}=\hbar\Omega_{\nu}\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\
0 & -1
\end{pmatrix}\begin{pmatrix}X^{\nu}\\
Y^{\nu}
\end{pmatrix}\label{eq:qrpa_matrix_equation}
\end{equation}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
唯独此时矩阵指标遍历组态空间中的所有准粒子对 
\begin_inset Formula $(k<k')$
\end_inset
。矩阵 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 和 
\begin_inset Formula $B$
\end_inset
 给定为（
\begin_inset Formula $k<k',\,l<l'$
\end_inset
）：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
A_{kk'll'} & =\langle\text{HFB}|[\alpha_{k'}\alpha_{k},[H,\alpha_{l}^{\dagger}\alpha_{l'}^{\dagger}]]|\text{HFB}\rangle=(E_{k}+E_{k'})\delta_{kl}\delta_{k'l'}+H_{kk'll'}^{22},\nonumber \\
B_{kk'll'} & =-\langle\text{HFB}|[\alpha_{k'}\alpha_{k},[H,\alpha_{l'}\alpha_{l}]]|\text{HFB}\rangle=H_{kk'll'}^{40}\label{eq:qrpa_ab_matrices_def}
\end{align}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
它们共同构成了 HFB 理论的稳定性矩阵［式 (7.37)］。在时间反演不变的规范基下，矩阵元可以利用 Bogoliubov 变换的 
\begin_inset Formula $u,v$
\end_inset
 系数显式计算：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
A_{kk'll'} & =(E_{k}+E_{k'})\delta_{kl}\delta_{k'l'}+\bar{v}_{kl'k'l}(u_{k}v_{k'}u_{l}v_{l'}+v_{k}u_{k'}v_{l}u_{l'})+\cdots,\nonumber \\
B_{kk'll'} & =\bar{v}_{kk'll'}(u_{k}u_{k'}v_{l}v_{l'}+v_{k}v_{k'}u_{l}u_{l'})+\cdots\label{eq:qrpa_uv_coefficients_explicit}
\end{align}
\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
在 Hartree-Fock 极限下（所有 
\begin_inset Formula $u=0,1$
\end_inset
），QRPA 方程自动退化并解耦为通常的粒子-空穴 RPA 方程与粒子-粒子 RPA 方程。
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
准粒子 RPA 方程已广泛应用于结合可分离相互作用（如配对加四极模型、表面 
\begin_inset Formula $\delta$
\end_inset
 相互作用）的研究中。它不仅能够成功描述球形超导核中的低激发集体振动，而且能够成功应用于形变稀土核和锕系核中 
\begin_inset Formula $\beta$
\end_inset
